WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.330
Have you ever wondered what SCP-2952, The
Corgi, wants?

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:10.991
Foundation staff snapped a picture of SCP-2952
using SCP-978, the Desire Camera, while it

00:00:10.991 --> 00:00:13.809
was being pet behind the ears by Researcher
Yew.

00:00:13.809 --> 00:00:16.200
This was the result:

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.740
"SCP-2952 has shifted onto its back.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.740
Agent Davies is now scratching its underbelly."

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:25.550
No matter how long it is, a dog is still a
dog.

